  "description": "Yun Byeol’s world is turned upside down when his brother, Hye-Seong, gets into an accident. But when Byeol visits him in the hospital, he’s surprised to find him in an expensive private room and learns that Hye-Seong received compensation for the incident. When he goes to confront Seong Un, the person who pushed his brother down the stairs, Byeol is met with another surprise: Un knows about a dark side of Hye-Seong that is hard to believe. What is their relationship, and why would Un push him?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
